From 3128febdf050ba17a61adb15d4d07c43b6587342 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kamil Monicz <kamil@monicz.dev>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:21:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Correct primitive buffer byte-order matching on
 little-endian hosts

Accept the little-endian format prefix instead of the big-endian prefix. Cover native, standard, explicit little/big, network and unmarked primitive formats, including a public Element predicate regression that fails for both reversed cases.
---
 newsfragments/0-endian.fixed.md   |  1 +
 pytests/src/buf_and_str.rs        |  6 ++++++
 pytests/tests/test_buf_and_str.py | 24 +++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/buffer.rs                     | 34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 newsfragments/0-endian.fixed.md

diff --git a/newsfragments/0-endian.fixed.md b/newsfragments/0-endian.fixed.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..e4b1c020
--- /dev/null
+++ b/newsfragments/0-endian.fixed.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Correct primitive buffer byte-order matching on little-endian platforms.
diff --git a/pytests/src/buf_and_str.rs b/pytests/src/buf_and_str.rs
index 3b621dce..d0b42204 100644
